    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:title>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">æˆäººè­˜åˆ¥æ©Ÿèƒ½ä»˜ãŸã°ã“è‡ªå‹•è²©å£²æ©Ÿ/A Japan Tobacco Inc. employee shows an IC card called "taspo" at the company headquarters in Tokyo, &#xA;&#xA;October 19, 2007 - News : &#xA;&#xA;A Japan Tobacco Inc. employee shows an IC card called "taspo" at the company headquarters in Tokyo October 19, 2007. Underage smokers in Japan will no longer be able to buy cigarettes from vending machines starting next year, with the launch of new machines requiring identification cards.   REUTERS/Toru Hanai (JAPAN)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
